WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Industrial cases reveal
practices worth testing.

00:00:03.144 --> 00:00:08.080
Generated tests can pass through build,
reliability and coverage gates.

00:00:08.196 --> 00:00:12.720
Diagnostic summaries can cite the log
lines behind a proposed cause.

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:17.600
Flaky-test repair can use execution
context while preserving the original

00:00:17.656 --> 00:00:22.320
assertion. The reusable lesson is
independent verification around

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:27.440
the AI output. These company-specific
cases demonstrate mechanisms;

00:00:27.472 --> 00:00:32.240
they do not establish a transferable bank
savings rate or a ranking of products.
